{"id":"wb-1-45","name":"北山摩崖造象","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"北山摩崖造像","text":"北山摩崖造像位于重庆市大足县城北1.5公里的北山（俗称佛湾，隶属于龙岗街道）。北山摩崖造像长约三百多米，是世界文化遗产——大足石刻的重要组成部分。1961年入选第一批全国重点文物保护单位，1999年大足石刻被列为世界文化遗产。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8C%97%E5%B1%B1%E6%91%A9%E5%B4%96%E9%80%A0%E5%83%8F","revisionId":92361769,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92361769","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/3676d602c66d0548bcbed99b.jpg","title":"Dazushike_Beishan.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dazushike_Beishan.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c2/Dazushike_Beishan.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Brookqi","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":"","caption":"​大足石刻－北山摩崖","width":320,"height":212}}